{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root cause confirmed read-only over SSM (2026-11-04 03:00 PST): the live container rebar-mcp-4496e9acd2a9-8092 mounts only gerrit_mcp_tickets, gerrit_mcp_code, /var/lib/rebar and two secrets; /var/gerrit/site/.rebar (where StorePaths.log puts compact-worker.log) is on the writable layer. The container logs via journald tag=rebar-mcp, and journalctl -t rebar-mcp still holds lines from 2026-10-30, i.e. it survives releases. Fix follows that precedent: compact.worker_log=stderr (REBAR_COMPACT_WORKER_LOG) set in compose and mcp_run_new. New tests failed before the fix (4 failed, 3 passed) and pass after; the touched files plus config/infra drift tests: 331 passed; make lint and make typecheck clean. Pushed as Gerrit 3300."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793793199123150001,"uuid":"4e5db108-e6bf-4b1b-9231-c4c7abd4ae12"}